Libraries bundled in Linux packages
-----------------------------------

The AppImage bundles Qt and the libraries above together with the
libraries they use (libtiff, libcurl, OpenSSL, zlib and others). It lists
each one, and the distribution package it comes from, in
usr/share/doc/terrasoar/bundled-libraries.txt, with each package's
copyright and licence file in usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright and the
LGPL v3 and GPL v3 texts in usr/share/doc/terrasoar/licences/. The
Flatpak builds GEOS, PROJ, GeographicLib and GDAL from their sources and
uses the KDE runtime (Qt and common libraries), which carries its own
notices.

