Downloadable data packs
-----------------------

The data packs offered in the program (File > Data Packs, hosted at
https://github.com/marutan/terrasoar-packs) are not part of the program;
each carries its licence notices in its licences/ folder. They contain:

bluemarble-full: the Blue Marble image above at full resolution
  (world.topo.bathy.200407.3x21600x10800.jpg). Public domain (NASA).

shoreline-full: GSHHG 2.3.7 above with its high and full resolutions
  (gshhg-shp-2.3.7.zip). GNU LGPL v3 or later.

geoid-egm2008-fine: the EGM2008 geoid above at its 2.5' grid
  (us_nga_egm08_25.tif). Public domain (NGA).

geoid-osgm15: OSGM15, Ordnance Survey's geoid model for Ordnance Datum
  Newlyn, Great Britain (uk_os_OSGM15_GB.tif as distributed by PROJ,
  unchanged). BSD 2-Clause licence (Ordnance Survey, via PROJ).
  Attribution: "OSGM15: Ordnance Survey"

The source tree also has test data that is not distributed:
tests/data/geodtest-sample.dat, a sample of C. F. F. Karney's "Test set
for geodesics", CC0 1.0, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.32156.

